node_modules/
# dist/ is INTENTIONALLY committed (was gitignored through v0.3.0).
# Reason: CC's marketplace install runs `bun install` but skips lifecycle
# scripts (no postinstall), so a built `dist/` MUST be present in the
# published artifact. Without it the MCP server can't spawn → bro can't
# onboard → silent install failure. v0.3.1 fixed this.
#
# Stale dist/ is caught by `tests/l1-lint/dist-fresh.sh` (CI). Contributors
# rebuild before commit; the lint blocks PRs with out-of-sync dist/.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.log
